    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strip Brick Breaker Simulator</strong> is a game where you can replace images with your favorite characters and enjoy a strip brick-breaking experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u2661\u2661 <strong>Custom Features</strong> \u2661\u2661\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Replaceable Images</strong><br>In addition to the regular image, you can set alternate images of the character looking embarrassed when all the blocks are about to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAs long as you have images for the blocks, it will work, so you can play it as a regular block breaker game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Character Names and Dialogues</strong><br>You can register names and dialogues for characters.<br>The dialogues can be finely tuned, such as for &quot;when the ball falls&quot; or &quot;when touched.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Blackout Mode</strong><br>You can black out the bricks with the blackout mode.<br>\u2661 <strong>Background Color Customization</strong><br>You can change the background color.<br>\u2661 <strong>Optional Strip Mode</strong><br>You can choose whether or not the character will be stripped after the game ends.<br>\u2661 <strong>Ball Physics Adjustment</strong><br>You can adjust parameters like gravity and jump strength for the ball.<br>\u2661 <strong>Quick Save</strong><br>You can register characters during gameplay, thanks to the quick save feature.<br>\u2661 <strong>Random Character Invocation</strong><br>You can set it up to randomly call upon registered characters during gameplay.<br>\u2661 <strong>Adjustable Play Time</strong><br>You can adjust the playtime, from a minimum of 1 minute to a maximum of 840 hours (more than a week!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sample character data is also included!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy conversations with a variety of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462100/extras/1aa8365c84f259bda39f508457c27468.avif?t=1739458816\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strip Brick Breaker Simulator</strong> is a game where you can replace images with your favorite characters and enjoy a strip brick-breaking experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u2661\u2661 <strong>Custom Features</strong> \u2661\u2661\u2661</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Replaceable Images</strong><br>In addition to the regular image, you can set alternate images of the character looking embarrassed when all the blocks are about to be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAs long as you have images for the blocks, it will work, so you can play it as a regular block breaker game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Character Names and Dialogues</strong><br>You can register names and dialogues for characters.<br>The dialogues can be finely tuned, such as for &quot;when the ball falls&quot; or &quot;when touched.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2661 <strong>Blackout Mode</strong><br>You can black out the bricks with the blackout mode.<br>\u2661 <strong>Background Color Customization</strong><br>You can change the background color.<br>\u2661 <strong>Optional Strip Mode</strong><br>You can choose whether or not the character will be stripped after the game ends.<br>\u2661 <strong>Ball Physics Adjustment</strong><br>You can adjust parameters like gravity and jump strength for the ball.<br>\u2661 <strong>Quick Save</strong><br>You can register characters during gameplay, thanks to the quick save feature.<br>\u2661 <strong>Random Character Invocation</strong><br>You can set it up to randomly call upon registered characters during gameplay.<br>\u2661 <strong>Adjustable Play Time</strong><br>You can adjust the playtime, from a minimum of 1 minute to a maximum of 840 hours (more than a week!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>sample character data is also included!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy conversations with a variety of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462100/extras/1aa8365c84f259bda39f508457c27468.avif?t=1739458816\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
